#Megahit on Full Reads:
This is the code used for generating the Seq2Sat assembly. This assembly is this "Big File", That is, the full assembly.
nohup megahit --presets meta-large --12 D4993_ALL_READS_DEDUPED_INTERLEAVED_CONCATD.fastq -t 115 -m 0.95 --mem-flag 0 -o /home/yggshare/current_projects/Seq2Sat/05.Assemblies/D4993-C5-LG3-Sat_ASSEMBLY & 

